45 780 Td
() Tj
T*
(   2. Physical Breakdown Mechanisms \(c. 2005 at 90nm/65nm nodes\):) Tj
T*
(   - Subthreshold Leakage: As threshold voltage Vt was scaled down below ~0.3 V to maintain) Tj
T*
(   switching speed at reduced Vdd, the subthreshold swing \(limited by Boltzmann thermal statistics) Tj
T*
(   to ~60 mV/decade at room temperature\) caused massive subthreshold leakage currents \(I_sub ~) Tj
T*
(   exp\(\(Vgs - Vt\)/\(m * kT/q\)\)\).) Tj
T*
(   - Gate Oxide Tunneling: Thinning SiO2 gate dielectric below 1.2 nm \(only ~5 atomic layers\) led) Tj
T*
(   to quantum mechanical Fowler-Nordheim and direct tunneling of electrons through the dielectric) Tj
T*
(   barrier, causing continuous static power dissipation even when transistors were idle.) Tj
T*
(   - The Dark Silicon Phenomenon: Total power dissipation exceeded thermal cooling package limits) Tj
T*
(   \(~100 W/cm^2\), terminating clock frequency scaling at ~3 to 4 GHz.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Modern Architectural and Technological Solutions:) Tj
T*
(   - Multi-Core and Parallel Computing: Transitioned from single power-hungry monolithic CPUs to) Tj
T*
(   multi-core architectures \(symmetric multi-processing and ARM big.LITTLE heterogeneous) Tj
T*
(   computing\).) Tj
T*
(   - Material Innovations: Introduction of High-k Metal Gate \(HKMG, Hafnium dioxide\) dielectrics) Tj
T*
(   at 45nm, strained silicon to boost carrier mobility, and 3D FinFET/GAAFET architectures.) Tj
T*
(   - Domain-Specific Accelerators: Shifting workloads to dedicated energy-efficient hardware) Tj
T*
(   engines \(GPUs, TPUs, Neural Processing Units \(NPUs\), and cryptographic coprocessors\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 3:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the fundamental principles of electromagnetic wave propagation established by Maxwell and Hertz, and explain how Marconi operationalized these discoveries into commercial wireless communication.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Maxwell's Theoretical Unification \(1865\):) Tj
T*
(   - James Clerk Maxwell formulated four coupled partial differential equations unifying electric) Tj
T*
(   and magnetic fields: Gauss's Law for electricity \(div D = rho\), Gauss's Law for magnetism \(div) Tj
T*
(   B = 0\), Faraday's Law of Induction \(curl E = -dB/dt\), and the Ampere-Maxwell Law with) Tj
T*
(   displacement current \(curl H = J + dD/dt\).) Tj
T*
(   - Crucially, Maxwell discovered that a time-varying electric field produces a time-varying) Tj
T*
(   magnetic field, which in turn induces a time-varying electric field, propagating) Tj
T*
(   self-sustainingly through free space as an electromagnetic transverse wave at velocity c = 1 /) Tj
T*
(   sqrt\(mu0 * epsilon0\) =~ 3 * 10^8 m/s.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Hertz's Experimental Verification \(1887\):) Tj
T*
(   - Heinrich Hertz constructed an experimental apparatus consisting of an induction coil) Tj
T*
(   connected to a spark-gap dipole oscillator with capacitive zinc spheres.) Tj
T*
(   - Across the laboratory, he placed a circular resonant wire loop with a tiny micrometer spark) Tj
T*
(   gap. When electrical sparks discharged across the primary transmitter, electromagnetic) Tj
T*
(   radiation radiated across space, inducing high-frequency currents in the receiver loop that) Tj
T*
(   generated microscopic sparks.) Tj
T*
(   - Hertz measured wave properties, conclusively demonstrating that RF waves undergo reflection) Tj
T*
(   from zinc sheets, refraction through pitch prisms, polarization, and propagate at the speed of) Tj
T*
(   light.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Marconi's Practical Engineering and Commercial System \(1895 - 1901\):) Tj
T*
(   - Ground-Wave and Sky-Wave Propagation: Marconi realized Hertzian waves attenuated rapidly with) Tj
T*
(   horizontal dipoles. He grounded one side of the spark gap and elevated the other side into a) Tj
T*
(   vertical wire \(monopole antenna\), creating the grounded Marconi antenna that coupled waves to) Tj
T*
(   the conductive Earth surface.) Tj
T*
(   - Receiver Sensitivity: Replaced crude spark detectors with sensitive Branly-lodge coherers) Tj
T*
(   \(metallic filings in a glass tube that coalesce upon RF excitation\), integrated with an) Tj
T*
ET

