(   flexible memory allocation, but suffers from the 'Von Neumann Bottleneck'?CPU cannot read an) Tj
T*
(   instruction and read/write a data word simultaneously, constraining memory throughput.) Tj
T*
(   - Harvard Architecture: Features physically separate memory spaces and dedicated independent) Tj
T*
(   buses for instructions \(Program Memory\) and data \(Data Memory\). Enables simultaneous) Tj
T*
(   instruction fetch and data read/write in a single clock cycle, forming the core architecture of) Tj
T*
(   modern DSPs and microcontrollers \(e.g., ARM Cortex-M\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. CISC \(Complex Instruction Set Computer\) Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - Philosophy: Developed when memory was scarce and expensive \(e.g., Intel x86\). Focuses on) Tj
T*
(   hardware execution of complex, multi-cycle instructions where a single instruction executes) Tj
T*
(   memory load, arithmetic operation, and memory store.) Tj
T*
(   - Trade-offs: Variable instruction lengths, complex microcode decoders, higher transistor count) Tj
T*
(   and thermal dissipation, making pipelining difficult.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. RISC \(Reduced Instruction Set Computer\) Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - Philosophy: Discovered that 80% of program execution relies on 20% of simple instructions.) Tj
T*
(   Standardizes on fixed-length instructions \(e.g., 32 bits\), load/store architecture \(arithmetic) Tj
T*
(   executes strictly between internal registers\), and hardwired single-cycle execution.) Tj
T*
(   - Advantages: Highly efficient instruction pipelining, lower silicon area, and vastly reduced) Tj
T*
(   power consumption \(ARM architecture dominating 99% of smartphones and mobile electronics\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. The Modern RISC-V Open Standard Revolution:) Tj
T*
(   - Open Instruction Set Architecture \(ISA\): Developed at UC Berkeley, providing a free,) Tj
T*
(   royalty-free, extensible ISA without vendor lock-in.) Tj
T*
(   - Modularity: Base integer ISA \(RV32I, RV64I\) paired with standard extensions: 'M' \(integer) Tj
T*
(   multiply/divide\), 'A' \(atomic\), 'F'/'D' \(single/double floating point\), 'C' \(compressed\), and) Tj
T*
(   custom accelerator opcodes, democratizing global chip design.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
