(   3. Algorithmic Speedup and Industrial Impact:) Tj
T*
(   - Computational Complexity Reduction: An N-point FFT requires log2\(N\) stages, each performing) Tj
T*
(   N/2 butterfly operations. Total complex multiplications drop to \(N / 2\) * log2\(N\).) Tj
T*
(   - Quantitative Comparison for N = 1024: \(1024 / 2\) * log2\(1024\) = 512 * 10 = 5,120 complex) Tj
T*
(   multiplications, representing a massive 205x speedup over direct DFT \(1,048,576 operations\)!) Tj
T*
(   - Applications: Makes real-time 5G/Wi-Fi OFDM subcarrier modulation, radar Doppler processing,) Tj
T*
(   speech recognition, and medical MRI reconstruction computationally feasible on embedded) Tj
