(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the antenna fundamentals: radiation mechanism, near-field vs far-field boundaries, half-wave dipole radiation pattern, directivity, antenna gain, and effective aperture.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Electromagnetic Radiation Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   - Accelerated Charges: Steady electric currents produce stationary magnetic fields, while) Tj
T*
(   uniformly moving charges produce steady conduction. Electromagnetic radiation occurs strictly) Tj
T*
(   when electrical charges undergo acceleration or deceleration \(Maxwell-Ampere dynamic field) Tj
T*
(   coupling\).) Tj
T*
