(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the emergence of Edge AI and TinyML in modern electronics, explaining model quantization from FP32 to INT8, pruning, and deployment on resource-constrained microcontrollers.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Edge AI & TinyML Paradigm:) Tj
T*
(   - Traditional Cloud AI sends raw sensor data over wireless networks to centralized cloud) Tj
T*
(   servers for deep learning inference. This suffers from high network latency, heavy wireless) Tj
T*
(   power consumption, bandwidth bottlenecks, and severe user data privacy risks.) Tj
T*
(   - TinyML executes quantized neural network inference directly on resource-constrained) Tj
T*
(   microcontrollers \(e.g., ARM Cortex-M4/M7, ESP32\) consuming milliwatts of power, operating from) Tj
T*
(   battery or energy harvesting sources without internet connectivity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Model Compression and Quantization Techniques:) Tj
T*
(   - FP32 to INT8 Quantization: Deep neural network weights and activations are typically trained) Tj
T*
(   using 32-bit floating-point \(FP32\) arithmetic. Post-training quantization maps continuous FP32) Tj
T*
(   values into 8-bit signed integers \(INT8\) using an affine transformation: q = round\( r / S \) +) Tj
T*
(   Z, where S is the scale factor and Z is zero-point offset.) Tj
T*
(   - Memory and Compute Benefits: Shrinks model memory footprint by 75% \(4 bytes down to 1 byte) Tj
T*
(   per parameter\), fitting models into internal microcontroller SRAM \(<256 KB\) and Flash \(<1 MB\).) Tj
T*
(   Replaces power-hungry floating-point hardware with fast single-cycle SIMD integer) Tj
T*
(   multiply-accumulate \(MAC\) instructions.) Tj
T*
(   - Weight Pruning: Identifies near-zero weight matrices and sets them to absolute zero, followed) Tj
T*
(   by sparse matrix encoding, reducing parameter count by 50% to 90% without sacrificing) Tj
T*
(   classification accuracy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Hardware Deployment Frameworks:) Tj
T*
(   - Lightweight runtimes such as TensorFlow Lite for Microcontrollers \(TFLM\) and CMSIS-NN) Tj
T*
(   directly utilize ARM Cortex-M DSP instruction extensions \(SMLAD - dual 16-bit MAC with 32-bit) Tj
T*
(   accumulate\) to execute real-time keyword spotting, predictive maintenance vibration analysis,) Tj
T*
ET

