(   3. ATPG and BIST Architectures:) Tj
T*
(   - Automatic Test Pattern Generation \(ATPG\): Software algorithms \(e.g., D-algorithm, PODEM\)) Tj
T*
(   analyze the gate-level netlist to synthesize the minimum set of test vectors that detect >99.5%) Tj
T*
(   of modeled physical faults \(Stuck-At-0, Stuck-At-1, and At-Speed Transition Delay faults\).) Tj
T*
(   - Built-In Self-Test \(BIST\): On-chip hardware engines designed to test internal blocks without) Tj
