(   - Physical Mechanism: In deep-submicron ICs, current densities in nanoscale copper) Tj
T*
(   interconnects exceed 10^6 A/cm^2. Moving conduction electrons collide with stationary metal) Tj
T*
(   lattice ions, exerting an electron wind force that transfers momentum to the metal atoms.) Tj
T*
(   - Failure Consequences: Over time, metal atoms migrate toward the anode, creating microscopic) Tj
T*
(   voids \(open circuit failures\) at the cathode and metal extrusions or hillocks \(short circuits) Tj
T*
(   with adjacent wires\) at the anode.) Tj
T*
(   - Black's Equation: Median Time to Failure \(MTTF\) is modeled as: MTTF = A * \(J^-n\) * exp\( Ea /) Tj
T*
(   \(k * T\) \), where J is current density, Ea is activation energy, T is temperature, and n =~ 1 to) Tj
T*
(   2. High current density and elevated operating temperatures exponentially accelerate failure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Stress Migration & Time-Dependent Dielectric Breakdown \(TDDB\):) Tj
T*
(   - Stress Migration: Caused by mechanical thermal-expansion mismatches between copper wires and) Tj
T*
(   surrounding low-k dielectric materials, creating tensile mechanical stress gradients that) Tj
T*
(   induce atomic void coalescence even in unpowered chips.) Tj
T*
(   - TDDB: Continuous electric field stress across ultra-thin gate oxides or inter-metal) Tj
T*
(   dielectrics creates electron traps. Eventually, a conductive percolation path forms through the) Tj
T*
(   insulating dielectric, resulting in destructive electrical short circuits.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Engineering Design and Layout Mitigation:) Tj
T*
(   - Adherence to Foundry EM Rules: EDA routing tools strictly enforce maximum DC and RMS current) Tj
T*
(   limits per unit wire width. High-current power rails are widened and routed with multi-cut via) Tj
T*
(   arrays to divide current paths.) Tj
T*
(   - Metallurgy Innovations: Thin barrier liners \(Cobalt, Ruthenium, Tantalum Nitride\) encapsulate) Tj
T*
(   copper traces to suppress surface diffusion of metal atoms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
