(   - Trade-offs: Simple low-cost implementation, but limited to two devices, sensitive to clock) Tj
T*
(   drift, and relatively slow.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Serial Peripheral Interface \(SPI\):) Tj
T*
(   - Architecture: Synchronous master-slave full-duplex bus using four lines: SCLK \(Serial Clock\),) Tj
T*
(   MOSI \(Master Out Slave In\), MISO \(Master In Slave Out\), and dedicated active-low Chip Select) Tj
T*
(   \(CS / SS\) lines per slave.) Tj
T*
(   - Trade-offs: High throughput \(>50-100 Mbps\), simple hardware shift register topology,) Tj
T*
(   configurable clock polarity/phase \(CPOL/CPHA\). However, pin count escalates linearly with) Tj
T*
(   number of slaves \(N+3 wires\), and lacks built-in acknowledgment or flow control.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Inter-Integrated Circuit \(I2C\):) Tj
T*
(   - Architecture: Synchronous multi-master/multi-slave 2-wire serial bus: SDA \(Serial Data\) and) Tj
T*
(   SCL \(Serial Clock\), both configured with open-drain outputs and pull-up resistors to Vdd.) Tj
T*
(   - Protocol: Software-addressed devices \(7-bit or 10-bit address\), bidirectional communication) Tj
T*
(   with hardware ACK/NACK handshake after every 8-bit byte. Speeds range from Standard Mode \(100) Tj
T*
(   kbps\) to Fast Mode \(400 kbps\) and High Speed \(3.4 Mbps\).) Tj
T*
(   - Trade-offs: Minimal PCB routing \(strictly 2 pins for dozens of ICs\). However, bus capacitance) Tj
T*
(   is limited to 400 pF, and pull-up resistors limit maximum speed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Controller Area Network with Flexible Data-Rate \(CAN-FD\):) Tj
T*
(   - Architecture: Asynchronous differential multi-master serial bus \(CAN_High, CAN_Low\)) Tj
T*
(   engineered for automotive and mission-critical harsh industrial environments.) Tj
T*
(   - Features: Non-destructive bitwise arbitration based on message identifiers, 120-Ohm) Tj
T*
(   terminating resistors, hardware CRC checks, and fault confinement. CAN-FD accelerates payload) Tj
T*
(   data rates up to 5-8 Mbps with up to 64 bytes per frame, delivering ultra-reliable real-time) Tj
T*
(   vehicular control.) Tj
T*
() Tj
