T*
(   1. High-Speed PCB Layer Stackup Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - For digital signals with fast transition edge rates \(rise time tr < 1 ns\), PCB traces act as) Tj
T*
(   distributed transmission lines. A 4-layer board must be structured as: Layer 1 \(Top Signal\) -) Tj
