(   Layer 2 \(Solid Ground Plane\) - Layer 3 \(Power Plane\) - Layer 4 \(Bottom Signal\).) Tj
T*
(   - Controlled Impedance: Trace width W, copper thickness t, and dielectric thickness h to the) Tj
T*
(   adjacent reference plane are calculated using electromagnetic field solvers to guarantee) Tj
T*
(   targeted 50-Ohm single-ended \(or 100-Ohm differential\) impedance: Z0 =~ \( 87 / sqrt\(epsilon_r +) Tj
T*
(   1.41\) \) * ln\( 5.98 * h / \(0.8 * W + t\) \).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. High-Frequency Ground Return Current Paths:) Tj
T*
(   - At DC, return current follows the path of least resistance \(straight line back to source\).) Tj
T*
(   - At high frequencies \(f > 100 kHz\), return current follows the path of least inductance! The) Tj
T*
(   return current gathers directly in the reference ground plane directly beneath the signal) Tj
T*
(   trace, minimizing the magnetic loop area.) Tj
T*
(   - Ground Plane Splits Hazard: Routing a high-speed trace across a split, gap, or slot in the) Tj
T*
(   reference plane forces the return current to divert around the opening, creating a large) Tj
T*
(   inductive current loop that radiates intense Electromagnetic Interference \(EMI\) and causes) Tj
T*
(   severe signal crosstalk.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Decoupling and Power Integrity \(PI\):) Tj
T*
(   - Fast switching CMOS ICs draw instantaneous current spikes \(di/dt\) from power rails. Parasitic) Tj
T*
(   trace inductance causes voltage drops \(Delta V = L * di/dt\), termed 'Ground Bounce' or 'Vdd) Tj
T*
(   Sag'.) Tj
T*
(   - Multi-Decade Decoupling: Ceramic capacitors \(e.g., 0.1 micro-Farad, 10 nF, 100 pF\) are placed) Tj
T*
(   immediately adjacent to each IC power pin \(<2 mm\) with low-inductance surface vias directly to) Tj
T*
(   internal ground/power planes to maintain low power distribution network \(PDN\) impedance across) Tj
T*
(   wide frequency bands.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
