(   [Problem Statement]: Synthesize the interdisciplinary role of modern Electronics and Communication Engineering in addressing global technological grand challenges: sustainable green computing, ubiquitous connectivity, and healthcare automation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Sustainable Green Computing and Energy-Efficient Silicon:) Tj
T*
(   - Global data centers and artificial intelligence computing clusters consume significant) Tj
T*
(   percentages of global electricity. ECE drives sustainable innovation through energy-efficient) Tj
T*
(   silicon architectures:) Tj
T*
(   - Wide-Bandgap Semiconductors: Transitioning from legacy silicon to Gallium Nitride \(GaN\) and) Tj
T*
(   Silicon Carbide \(SiC\) power devices that switch at higher frequencies with 98%+ power) Tj
T*
(   conversion efficiency, vastly reducing energy losses in data center server power supplies,) Tj
T*
(   solar inverters, and electric vehicle drivetrains.) Tj
T*
(   - Near-Threshold and Neuromorphic Computing: Engineering brain-inspired neuromorphic chips) Tj
T*
(   \(spiking neural networks\) that consume microwatts by computing in-memory, avoiding the power) Tj
T*
(   penalty of shuttling data across traditional memory buses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Ubiquitous Planetary Connectivity and Digital Equity:) Tj
T*
(   - Bridging the Global Digital Divide: Traditional terrestrial fiber and cellular networks leave) Tj
T*
(   rural and oceanic regions unconnected. ECE engineers design Low-Earth-Orbit \(LEO\) satellite) Tj
T*
(   communication mega-constellations operating phased-array beamforming antennas and) Tj
T*
(   inter-satellite optical laser crosslinks.) Tj
T*
(   - Smart Agriculture and Environmental Monitoring: Massive deployment of ultra-low-power IoT) Tj
T*
(   sensor networks monitoring soil moisture, agricultural pests, deforestation, and ocean acidity,) Tj
T*
(   powered by ambient RF energy harvesting and solar transducers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Healthcare Automation and Cyber-Physical Medical Systems:) Tj
T*
(   - Personalized Telemedicine: Wearable non-invasive biosensors continuously tracking ECG,) Tj
T*
(   photoplethysmogram \(PPG\) pulse oximetry, blood pressure, and interstitial glucose levels in) Tj
T*
